<title>UK: London gold fixes easier, faces key support level.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier, faces key support level.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $343.35 vs $344.50 on Friday. Lower after pressure from Bundesbank news and silver, platinum selling Friday. Faces key level at $342-$343. Most of Europe closed.</p>
<p>SILVER - Cent lower at $4.69/$4.71. Under pressure after fund selling Friday.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also weaker at $388.25/$389.25, down $2.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Fairly steady at $170.50/$171.50.</p>
</text>
